zer and his team to Victory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2>Multiple playable characters<br>Real-time character swapping<br>Unlockable special ability<br>Non-linear progression<br>Simple currency system to buy more health<br>Skippable cutscenes<br>Lots of useless NPC dialog!<br>9 fully fleshed-out levels<br>10 challenging bosses<br>Panzer!!! (need we say more?!)<br><br><strong>THE SEQUEL TO THE GREATEST VIDEO GAME OF ALL TIME! *</strong><br><i>*Verified personally by General Panzer himself</i>",
